  "notes": "Table 6 is indicated for right-hand traffic; the text does not state that the values are mirrored for left-hand traffic, so mirroring is disabled. Not encoded: overhead-sign sums S50+S50LL+S50RR and S100+S100LL+S100RR (the schema has no sum element); \"Segment 10 and below\" below 4°D; matched-pair note a; note b (position lamps may be activated for the S-points); para. 5.2.3 (no lateral variations in zone III). Aim: nominal cut-off \"one per cent (0.57°) below the H-H line\" (Annex 5, 3.2.1.1); elbow kink \"basically within +/-0.5°\" of V-V (3.2.1.2 (c), not encoded); alignment change at most 0.75° left/right and 0.25° up/down (Annex 5, 4.1 (a))."
